    {
      "name": "cube-dsh-free",
      "title": {
        "en": "Cube_DSH_Free local search",
        "zh": "Cube_DSH_Free 本地搜索"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Switches the backend behind web_search and web_fetch. Official only, local only, or automatic in-call fallback. Per-source cookies with engine recognition, source toggling, priority ordering, and user-defined sources. Tool names, parameters and result formats stay unchanged.",
        "zh": "切换 web_search 与 web_fetch 的后端。官方 API、本地 API，或自动切换。支持按搜索源分别配置 Cookie 并自动识别来源，也支持开关、排序与自定义搜索源。工具名、参数与结果格式完全不变。"
      },
